      <notesStmt>
        <note>This article presents a newly identified manuscript of the Chronica Naierensis, held in the Biblioteca Capitular y Colombina de Sevilla (59-4-25). The author demonstrates that this manuscript (C) is a direct copy (apograph) of the manuscript S (Madrid, Biblioteca de la Real Academia de la Historia, 9/450). The article includes a detailed analysis of the manuscript's errors, omissions, and corrections, and concludes with a stemma codicum illustrating the relationship between the manuscripts.</note>
      </notesStmt>
